{"games":[{"id":14074409839,"name":"obby but you're a fish","desc":"🐟 be the bigger fish and climb the deep blue abyss into a better life as a poorly evolved aquatic species \n\n🛠️ if you find any bugs or have a suggestion then post it on the group wall!\n\n\n ⭐ Join the group for a FREE ingame face! - https://www.roblox.com/groups/5692233\n\n\n❗ WARNING: Game contains environments which may be unnerving to those with thalassophobia \n\nCredits: \nHead-Dev, Builder: Bad_Yam \nBuilder, Lighting: SorrowZed \nScripter: MisterPhilo, K0NNM4NN\n\n❕ inspired by obby but you're a bird, steep steps and Abyss World ❕","path":"/game/14074409839-obby-but-you-re-a-fish","slug":"14074409839-obby-but-you-re-a-fish","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cf8f7afd2dce9873cde4344596abdc0b71a1d7d46fb5fd42248d83fc64e3fd98.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6f9014eaedccde490d6230108d7c14e5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":12045827,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-10-15T13:12:24.481Z","creator":{"name":"Kιngsmen","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13999740606,"name":"[FREE UGC] Ninja Fighting Simulator","desc":"❗ Use code 'UPDATE' for a SECRET pet!\n🚶‍♂️ New Friend Rewards!\n⌚ Performance Improvements!\n🔒 Pet Locking Out Now!\n\n⚔️ Welcome to Ninja Fighting Simulator! \n\n⚔️ Swing your katana to train your katana and unlock better ones! \n💥 Train your nunchucks to train them and unlock better ones! \n👊 Hit punching bags to train your punching power! \n🐶 Collect and discover new pets in your first area and more!\n💰 Premium players get a permanent buff while playing the game! \n\n❓ Find a bug? Join our group and report it, we will fix it as fast as possible! \n💖 Made with love and a lack of sleep for 3 days.","path":"/game/13999740606-ninja-fighting-simulator","slug":"13999740606-ninja-fighting-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/fd17a42a8e657596f66f603f3722b32742a4df6902863df7539abca3fe8ba5d2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ab48db0e6963bed9289b06158cc3881a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":32361572,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-10-03T19:57:19.412Z","creator":{"name":"Ninja Simulatr","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9840387028,"name":"[UPDATE 2.5] Era of Althea","desc":"Era of Althea welcomes those who favor adventure and exploration. Dive into a world of magic where all who enter have the chance to become a great fighter. While adventures may prove to be difficult, persevering and overcoming them will be fulfilling.\n\nThose who dwell in this realm progress by exploring the land and its secrets. Level up to achieve great feats, obtain rare items to assist you in battle, or band together to form guilds. There are many possibilities as to how you may choose to endure the trials found within the world of Althea.\n\nThis game is inspired by Black Clover & Sword Art Online, though it is created by our original concepts.\n\nM - Open Menu\nQ - Dash\nR - Toggle Fist Combat\nF - Toggle Weapon\nLMB - Attack (Fist or Weapons must be equipped)\nRMB - Block (Fist or Weapons must be equipped)\nShift - Run (Can be changed in Settings)\nAlt - Shiftlock\n~ - View Grimoire Pages","path":"/game/9840387028-era-of-althea","slug":"9840387028-era-of-althea","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a0d5c14da2388245faa10017147ffec34703c985a62ffad4a228849fe021da36.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0c60bd24ac6d386d55881f4632a4bf0c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":13996948,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-26T23:36:43.601Z","creator":{"name":"arcadias games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":1764816771,"name":"Wrestling 2X22","desc":"[⚠️ CONTROLS & INFO⚠️]\nhttps://devforum.roblox.com/t/wrestling-2x-controls-information/4523805\n\nWelcome to Wrestling 2X, the original, most authentic wrestling experience (until WrestlingX came out) on Roblox!\n\n[ FEATURES ]\n- Create An Wrestler, including your own Entrance & Moveset!\n- Exhibition, win championships and main events!\n- Performance Center, get some practice in!\n- Create A Federation, make the next WWE, AEW, or your own!\n\n🌟 Credits 🌟\nThanks to the community for continuously providing animations after launch!","path":"/game/1764816771-wrestling-2x22","slug":"1764816771-wrestling-2x22","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7d6b669596f3f3ebff3c8d7c40b8e86c0a27f5242fdfd94391ab8e73ea46e8cd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bb04ed3d20f419018b138f39883dc211/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":13288782,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-04-10T18:55:23.046Z","creator":{"name":"Liliardio","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":10146432319,"name":"Guacathon with Denzel Curry","desc":"🙌 Celebrate the life of Joaquin Oliver in this colorful music & art street festival hosted by Change The Ref. Explore the vibrant block party's activities and learn more about what Guacathon is all about!\r\n\r\n🎨 Share your creativity in Paint Zone by painting incredible murals from world-renowned artist Shepard Fairey\r\n🏀 Game up at the basketball court in Hoop Jam\r\n🎩 Grab FREE virtual merchandise for your avatar & check out special items created in collaboration with Denzel Curry & Shepard Fairy!\r\n\r\nDenzel Curry's concert is now complete, thanks for celebrating with us!\r\n\r\nA portion of all proceeds from sales of virtual goods are donated to Change the Ref.\r\n\r\n🚨 Players with photosensitive conditions, including epilepsy, should be aware that this experience contains flashing lights & patterns. Older devices may not experience gameplay or concert as intended.\r\n\r\n","path":"/game/10146432319-guacathon-with-denzel-curry","slug":"10146432319-guacathon-with-denzel-curry","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6303c56cecb29b